-- [T6] ENERGY-MOMENTUM RELATION: E² = (pc)² + (mc²)²
-- The key identity is γ²(1 − v²/c²) = 1. From it, with E = γmc²
-- and p = γmv, the invariant-mass relation follows exactly.
